# Barn owl

The barn owl is the owl in this notebook. Its name is the key
`barn-owl`; its card is a member of the wiki's `Set<Card>`.

[[field-notes]] records it twice. Both observations remain in the sightings
list, while the set of species contains it once.

Other species in the notebook: [[common-raven]] and [[european-robin]].
